=== AUDIT_EVIDENCE ===

Check 1 — MQTTDLQPublisher constructor + struct (mqtt.go:831-882).
  type MQTTDLQPublisher struct {
      client       pahomqtt.Client
      topicPrefix  string
      publishQoS   byte
